  "ruleText": "Env-A 2902.36 “Serial number” means the unique number assigned to a specific allowance by the ATS administrator that identifies the allowance and indicates the year of allocation.\n\nSource. #10002, eff 10-1-11 (from Env-A 2903.37); ss by #12995, eff 2-25-20 (formerly Env-A 2903.37)",
